An example in which 4-cores are simultaneously writing to
four distinct arrays, which are not overlapping.

Use of the cpu-id (asr29) to program the different cores in a 4-core processor.

Note that cpu-0 will setup the page tables.  Each cpu will
have a different initial stack pointer value.

To compile
./compile_for_ajit.sh

To run
./run_cmodel.sh
cat serial.out




